.IX Title "Lucy::Search::Span 3pm"
.TH Lucy::Search::Span 3pm 2026-09-16 "perl v5.40.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
