.Ve
.PP
Setter for \f(CW\*(C`weight\*(C'\fR attribute.
.SS compare_to
.IX Subsection "compare_to"
.Vb 1
\&    my $int = $span\->compare_to($other);
.Ve
.PP
Indicate whether one object is less than, equal to, or greater than
another.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBother\fR \- Another Obj.
.PP
Returns: 0 if the objects are equal, a negative number if
\&\f(CW\*(C`self\*(C'\fR is less than \f(CW\*(C`other\*(C'\fR, and a positive
number if \f(CW\*(C`self\*(C'\fR is greater than \f(CW\*(C`other\*(C'\fR.
